								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>The Prologue</strong> serves as the introductory chapter to the full experience of <strong>Phantom Line</strong>. </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088140/extras/ab191816890a0ecf5e4184d1ef9bee2b.poster.avif?t=1793011799" width=1170 height=390 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088140/extras/ab191816890a0ecf5e4184d1ef9bee2b.webm?t=1793011799" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088140/extras/ab191816890a0ecf5e4184d1ef9bee2b.mp4?t=1793011799" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088140/extras/cc986d0b6ccefd06215d90d5d233571b.avif?t=1793011799" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088140/extras_big/cc986d0b6ccefd06215d90d5d233571b.webp?t=1793011799 width=1560 height=193 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Step into the boots of the <strong>OPERATOR</strong>, battle terrifying entities, and test your skills before the full mission begins. You are a part of an elite spec-op unit that deals with anomalies - bizarre and inexplicable events hidden from the public. You work for a mysterious megacorp called Mortfield Industries.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >One of Mortfield's research facilities, placed in the <strong>IRON CORRIDOR</strong> - an Eastern Europe region torn by international tensions and paranormal activities - has lost contact with HQ. You’ve been sent there to investigate and secure the perimeter, as nuclear war just breaks out.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Now, you must deal not only with tears in the fabric of space-time and monstrous entities, but also with a serious international conflict. With fire and chaos spreading quickly, you and your friends are on the frontline of humanity as its last defense.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Will you be able to fulfill your mission? Are you willing to die again and again for the cause?</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088140/extras/c28c5371b5a94c83dcc262cffabd8a28.poster.avif?t=1793011799" width=1170 height=390 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088140/extras/c28c5371b5a94c83dcc262cffabd8a28.webm?t=1793011799" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088140/extras/c28c5371b5a94c83dcc262cffabd8a28.mp4?t=1793011799" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088140/extras/92acff09a3d2c6a7976b034352ccf263.avif?t=1793011799" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088140/extras_big/92acff09a3d2c6a7976b034352ccf263.webp?t=1793011799 width=1560 height=193 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >This is your secret and a most powerful weapon. Mortfield’s Operator Simulation Program called H.U.S.K. allows you to transfer your consciousness between artificial bodies. Use them in your tactics: scout, distract, decoy, or utilize many other strategies and commands to gain an advantage over anything in the way.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088140/extras/2e4ff1d02da2de47c589bed0dcdd5ab1.avif?t=1793011799" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088140/extras_big/2e4ff1d02da2de47c589bed0dcdd5ab1.webp?t=1793011799 width=1560 height=193 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Humanity is at war - to fight the anomalous horror you must turn into one yourself. Wield the H.U.S.K.s for the cause. Gather and upgrade your body with Quintessence, a substance you get after containing anomalies. Become the ultimate anomaly hunter. Go die again.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088140/extras/c3ecdc997c322d02368055e75539dfdd.poster.avif?t=1793011799" width=1170 height=390 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088140/extras/c3ecdc997c322d02368055e75539dfdd.webm?t=1793011799" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5088140/extras/c3ecdc997c322d02368055e75539dfdd.mp4?t=1793011799" type="video/mp4"></video></span>  </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >We think you'll love <strong>Phantom Line</strong> if you enjoyed: <i>Ready or Not</i>, <i>GTFO</i>, <i>Gray Zone Warfare</i>, <i>The Outlast Trials</i>, <i>Phasmophobia</i>, <i>Abiotic Factor</i>, <i>SCP: 5K</i>, <i>ARK: Survival Ascended</i>, <i>Trepang2</i>, <i>Ardem</i>, <i>SCP: Secret Laboratory</i>, <i>STALZONE</i>, <i>Atomfall</i>, <i>Sunkenland</i>, <i>Humanitz</i>, <i>Road to Vostok</i>.</p>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					Phantom Line: Prologue contains some voices generated by voice synthesizers.				</i>
			</p>
					</div>
	</div>
