			<h2>Mature Content Description</h2>
			<p>The developers describe the content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
			Phantom Line: Prologue contains intense violence, blood and combat, as well as horror themes. It also explores mature story themes, including conspiracy theories, which are intended for mature audiences.				</i>
			</p>
		</div>
